WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,200
Veteran, what did you say?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,200
You talk about money with a strong man of this level?

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,950
Isn't this an insult to him? Senior?

4
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:13,950
Our Zhenggui Bureau is willing to spend 30 million

5
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:17,880
I don’t know if you are satisfied enough, Lao Chen

6
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,880
Say no more

7
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,880
Stop using such vulgar things as money

8
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,880
Come to insult this senior

9
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:28,030
Didn’t you see that senior is already angry?

10
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,030
fifty million

11
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:31,030
Senior, what do you think of this number?

12
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:35,230
This time it's thorough

13
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:37,420
Made this senior angry

14
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,420
80 million

15
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,460
Eighty million seniors

16
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,460
What do you think of 80 million?

17
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,460
Enough, veteran

18
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
You have to kill both of us.
